---
# Static-analysis gate for src/ (run via scripts/run_static.sh stage 4 or CI).
#
# WarningsAsErrors '*' — everything enabled is a hard gate; the tree must be
# clean, not merely "tolerated". Excluded checks below are architectural
# decisions of this engine, documented next to the code they describe:
#
#  - bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters
#      The public API is numeric by design (id/price/quantity/side on one
#      cache-friendly call); its ordering is guarded by the differential
#      fuzzer against StdOrderBook, not by type-system noise.
#  - bugprone-exception-escape
#      main()/callbacks are noexcept-audited; fault paths abort on purpose.
#  - cppcoreguidelines-macro-usage
#      Macros.h is the platform/instrumentation layer by design
#      (HFT_LIKELY/HFT_PREFETCH/HFT_DEBUG_TOOLS cannot be constexpr
#      templates portably across GCC/Clang/MSVC).
#  - cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-array-to-pointer-decay and
#    cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-pointer-arithmetic
#      The pool and prefetch paths are C-interop byte-level code.
#  - cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-vararg
#      fprintf/snprintf are the deliberate exception-free diagnostics.
#  - modernize-use-trailing-return-type
#      Project style: leading return types.
Checks: 'performance-*,bugprone-*,modernize-*,cppcoreguidelines-*,-bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,-bugprone-exception-escape,-cppcoreguidelines-macro-usage,-cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-array-to-pointer-decay,-cppcoreguidelines-pro-bounds-pointer-arithmetic,-cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-vararg,-modernize-use-trailing-return-type'
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: 'src/.*'
FormatStyle: file
...
